The file public/fly.glb is a derivative work: it was generated from flygym's
simplified NeuroMechFly meshes (src/flygym/assets/model/neuromechfly/), posed
in flygym's neutral pose with MuJoCo forward kinematics, mirrored for the right
side, recoloured from visuals.yaml and compressed. See tools/bake_fly.py.

The built website bundles three.js (MIT, Copyright 2010-2026 three.js authors)
and the meshoptimizer decoder (MIT, Copyright 2016-2026 Arseny Kapoulkine). Their
licence texts are in public/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt, which is deployed with the site.

